#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_list.html:13
msgid "Books kept until"
msgstr "Bokföringen sparas till"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/retention.html:32
msgid "Now"
msgstr "Nu"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/retention.html:44
msgid "Keep everything"
msgstr "Spara allt"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/retention.html:44
msgid "Minimum passed for vouchers and receipts; keep the books"
msgstr "Minimitiden har gått ut för verifikat och kvitton; spara bokföringen"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/retention.html:44
msgid "Minimum passed"
msgstr "Minimitiden har gått ut"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/retention.html:53
msgid "Nothing is removed automatically"
msgstr "Inget tas bort automatiskt"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/retention.html:54
msgid ""
"These are the shortest times the Accounting Act allows, and Metra keeps "
"everything after them as well. Other rules can require keeping material "
"longer: the terms of a grant, the 10-year VAT adjustment period of a "
"property investment, or an open tax audit, appeal or dispute. Check those "
"before removing anything. Removing a year whose time has passed is not "
"offered in Metra yet; when it is due, export the year first and decide with "
"the board and the auditor."
msgstr ""
"Det här är de kortaste tider som bokföringslagen tillåter, och Metra sparar "
"allt även efter dem. Andra regler kan kräva att material sparas längre: "
"villkoren för ett bidrag, justeringsperioden på 10 år för moms på en "
"fastighetsinvestering, eller en pågående skatterevision, ett besvär eller en"
" tvist. Kontrollera dem innan något tas bort. Att ta bort en period vars tid"
" har gått ut erbjuds ännu inte i Metra; när det är dags, exportera perioden "
"först och besluta tillsammans med styrelsen och revisorn."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/retention.html:62
msgid "Personal data in the books"
msgstr "Personuppgifter i bokföringen"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/retention.html:63
msgid ""
"Vouchers, receipts and the invoices they rest on can name members and "
"suppliers. They are bookkeeping material that the law requires to be kept, "
"so they are kept for these periods even when a person asks to have their "
"data erased (GDPR article 17(3)(b)). Changing or archiving a person or unit "
"in the register does not change anything already booked: the books keep the "
"names and amounts as they were booked."
msgstr ""
"Verifikat, kvitton och de fakturor de bygger på kan nämna medlemmar och "
"leverantörer. De är bokföringsmaterial som lagen kräver att man sparar, så "
"de sparas under dessa tider även när en person begär att få sina uppgifter "
"raderade (GDPR artikel 17.3 b). Att ändra eller arkivera en person eller "
"enhet i registret ändrar ingenting som redan har bokförts: bokföringen "
"behåller namnen och beloppen så som de bokfördes."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/series_form.html:3
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/series_form.html:5
msgid "Edit voucher series"
msgstr "Redigera verifikatserie"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/trial_balance.html:12
msgid ""
"Every account's balance at the start and end of the period, and the period's"
" debits and credits. Balances are debit minus credit; they add up to zero."
msgstr ""
"Varje kontos saldo vid periodens början och slut samt periodens debet och "
"kredit. Saldot är debet minus kredit; saldona summerar till noll."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_confirm_delete.html:3
