#, python-format
msgid ""
"Delete the draft \"%(description)s\" and its receipts? Drafts have no "
"number, so this leaves no gap."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort utkastet \"%(description)s\" och dess kvitton? Utkast har inget "
"nummer, så det blir ingen lucka."

