#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:3
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:6
msgid "Edit draft voucher"
msgstr "Redigera verifikatutkast"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:8
msgid ""
"Each line goes to one account, as a debit or a credit. Debits and credits "
"must add up to the same amount before the voucher can be posted. A receipt "
"can be attached once the draft is saved."
msgstr ""
"Varje rad hör till ett konto, som debet eller kredit. Debet och kredit måste"
" vara lika stora innan verifikatet kan bokföras. Ett kvitto kan bifogas när "
"utkastet är sparat."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:18
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:21
msgid "Lines"
msgstr "Rader"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:41
msgid "Save to get more empty lines."
msgstr "Spara för att få fler tomma rader."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:41
msgid ""
"VAT: mark the line with the price without VAT (for example the expense) and "
"the VAT line with the same VAT code, at the rate in force on the voucher's "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Moms: märk raden med priset utan moms (till exempel utgiften) och momsraden "
"med samma momskod, med den sats som gäller på verifikatets datum."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:46
msgid "Save draft"
msgstr "Spara utkast"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_form.html:47
msgid "Save and post"
msgstr "Spara och bokför"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_reverse.html:3
msgid "Reverse voucher"
msgstr "Gör rättelse av verifikat"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_reverse.html:5
#, python-format
msgid "Reverse %(voucher)s"
msgstr "Gör rättelse av %(voucher)s"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_reverse.html:6
msgid ""
"A posted voucher never changes. To correct it, a new voucher with the same "
"lines on the opposite side cancels it, and both stay in the books. Then "
"enter the right entry as a new voucher."
msgstr ""
"Ett bokfört verifikat ändras aldrig. För att rätta det upphäver ett nytt "
"verifikat med samma rader på motsatt sida det, och båda finns kvar i "
"bokföringen. Ange sedan den rätta bokföringsposten som ett nytt verifikat."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/voucher_reverse.html:15
msgid "Post the reversal"
msgstr "Bokför rättelsen"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_bank.html:3
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_bank.html:5
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:56
msgid "Bank statements"
msgstr "Kontoutdrag"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_bank.html:7
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The balance of each account on the bank statement on %(day)s, and which "
"statement it is. The balance sheet specifications compare them with the "
"books; keep the statements themselves with the bookkeeping material."
msgstr ""
"Saldot på varje konto enligt kontoutdraget den %(day)s, och vilket utdrag "
"det är. Balansspecifikationerna jämför dem med bokföringen; förvara själva "
"utdragen tillsammans med bokföringsmaterialet."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_bank.html:25
msgid "The chart of accounts has no bank or cash accounts."
msgstr "Kontoplanen saknar bank- och kassakonton."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:11
msgid "First day"
msgstr "Första dag"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:12
msgid "Last day"
msgstr "Sista dag"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:14
msgid "Not 12 months because"
msgstr "Inte 12 månader eftersom"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:15
msgid "Average staff"
msgstr "Genomsnittligt antal anställda"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:16
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_export.html:17
msgid "Posted vouchers"
msgstr "Bokförda verifikat"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:17
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_export.html:19
msgid "Drafts"
msgstr "Utkast"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:18
msgid "Locked until"
msgstr "Låst till och med"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:18
msgid "Nothing is locked yet."
msgstr "Inget är låst ännu."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:18
msgid ""
"Nothing can be posted on or before this day. Lock each month once it is "
"reported, for example in the VAT return."
msgstr ""
"Inget kan bokföras på eller före den här dagen. Lås varje månad när den har "
"rapporterats, till exempel i momsdeklarationen."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:19
msgid "Financial statements due"
msgstr "Bokslutet ska vara klart"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:19
msgid "Within four months of the end of the year."
msgstr "Inom fyra månader efter årets slut."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:22
msgid "Result carried to"
msgstr "Resultatet förs till"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:24
msgid ""
"Financial statements, journal, ledger, chart of accounts and list of books: "
"10 years from the end of the financial year."
msgstr ""
"Bokslut, dagbok, huvudbok, kontoplan och förteckning över bokföringar och "
"material: 10 år från utgången av räkenskapsperioden."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:25
msgid ""
"Vouchers and receipts: 6 years from the end of the calendar year in which "
"the financial year ended."
msgstr ""
"Verifikat och kvitton: 6 år från utgången av det kalenderår då "
"räkenskapsperioden slutade."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:27
msgid ""
"These are the shortest times the law allows. Nothing is deleted "
"automatically."
msgstr ""
"Det här är de kortaste tider som lagen tillåter. Inget tas bort automatiskt."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:32
msgid "Lock"
msgstr "Lås"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:33
msgid ""
"A lock cannot be undone. Records from invoicing dated in a locked period are"
" booked on the first open day, with a note."
msgstr ""
"En låsning kan inte ångras. Poster från faktureringen som är daterade i en "
"låst period bokförs på första öppna dag, med en anteckning."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:44
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:46
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:3
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:6
msgid "Year-end"
msgstr "Bokslut"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:47
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:7
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:70
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_export.html:40
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_package.html:3
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_package.html:6
msgid "Year-end package"
msgstr "Bokslutspaket"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:48
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_export.html:3
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_export.html:6
msgid "Export the books"
msgstr "Exportera bokföringen"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_detail.html:49
msgid "Next year"
msgstr "Nästa år"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:11
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The year was closed on %(day)s. Its books can no longer change; errors found"
" now are corrected in the open year."
msgstr ""
"Året stängdes %(day)s. Dess bokföring kan inte längre ändras; fel som hittas"
" nu rättas i det öppna året."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:13
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Go through the steps below, then close the year. Closing locks the year for "
"good, keeps its chart of accounts as it reads today, and opens the next year"
" with the closing balances as its opening balances. The financial statements"
" are due by %(due)s, four months after the end of the year."
msgstr ""
"Gå igenom stegen nedan och stäng sedan året. Stängningen låser året för "
"gott, bevarar dess kontoplan som den ser ut i dag och öppnar nästa år med "
"utgående balanser som ingående balanser. Bokslutet ska vara klart senast "
"%(due)s, fyra månader efter årets slut."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:22
msgid "Depreciation by plan"
msgstr "Avskrivning enligt plan"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:28
msgid "Make the depreciation voucher"
msgstr "Skapa avskrivningsverifikatet"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:31
#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/views.py:290
msgid "The asset register has no depreciation for the year."
msgstr "Anläggningsregistret har ingen avskrivning för året."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:36
msgid "Invoiced income across the year end"
msgstr "Fakturerade intäkter över årsskiftet"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:38
msgid ""
"These invoices are for supplies on both sides of the year end. Their income "
"is shared by supply days: income for this year invoiced after it is accrued,"
" and income for the next year invoiced in this one is deferred."
msgstr ""
"Dessa fakturor gäller leveranser på båda sidor om årsskiftet. Intäkten delas"
" enligt leveransdagar: intäkter för det här året som fakturerats efter det "
"periodiseras som upplupna, och intäkter för nästa år som fakturerats under "
"det här som förutbetalda."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:39
msgid "accrued"
msgstr "upplupet"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:39
msgid "deferred"
msgstr "förutbetalt"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:39
#, python-format
msgid "%(days)s of %(total)s supply days"
msgstr "%(days)s av %(total)s leveransdagar"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:41
msgid "No invoices are for supplies across the year end."
msgstr "Inga fakturor gäller leveranser över årsskiftet."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:47
msgid "Invoices have changed since the accrual voucher was made."
msgstr "Fakturorna har ändrats sedan periodiseringsverifikatet gjordes."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:49
msgid "Make the accrual voucher"
msgstr "Skapa periodiseringsverifikatet"

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:52
msgid ""
"The share by supply days is a suggestion; have an accountant confirm the "
"method if the supplies are uneven."
msgstr ""
"Fördelningen enligt leveransdagar är ett förslag; låt en revisor eller "
"bokförare bekräfta metoden om leveranserna är ojämna."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:53
msgid ""
"Other accruals (costs of the year billed later, income received in advance) "
"are entered as vouchers of the kind Accrual, dated the last day of the year."
" Closing the year reverses every accrual on the first day of the next one."
msgstr ""
"Andra periodiseringar (årets kostnader som faktureras senare, inkomster som "
"erhållits i förväg) görs som verifikat av typen Periodisering, daterade "
"årets sista dag. När året stängs görs rättelse av varje periodisering den "
"första dagen i nästa år."

#: plugins/bookkeeping/src/metra_bookkeeping/templates/metra_bookkeeping/year_end.html:58
